<iscomment>
    Summary partial for Unified Checkout alternate payment methods (iDEAL, Multibanco,
    Tink Pay by Bank, BNPL, ...). These carry no card/bank-account data; the human-readable
    scheme name is recorded on the payment transaction as paymentDetails at order placement
    (see CheckoutServices-PlaceOrderDirect / ucPaymentHelper.getApmDisplayName). Gated on its
    own data so a missing value suppresses the line rather than rendering an empty element.
</iscomment>
<div class="alt-payment-method">
    <isif condition="${!empty(payment.paymentDetails)}">
        <span>${payment.paymentDetails}</span>
    </isif>
</div>
